{"ep": "20", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:01.32", "end": "0:00:03.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以下是社团接力赛跑"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:04.48", "end": "0:00:05.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "各就位"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:06.18", "end": "0:00:06.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "预备！"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:16.57", "end": "0:00:17.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "上了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:22.37", "end": "0:00:23.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:28.43", "end": "0:00:32.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  明明考虑的是我跑最后一棒确保第一的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:32.79", "end": "0:00:35.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这不成了全靠有希才赢的吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:36.98", "end": "0:00:38.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "跑得可真快啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 8, "start": "0:00:39.16", "end": "0:00:42.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "田径部不会因此丧失信心就好了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 9, "start": "0:00:42.70", "end": "0:00:44.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要笑咪咪地说这事啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 10, "start": "0:00:45.03", "end": "0:00:47.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "多亏这次冠军  我们的变态程度又高了不少了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 11, "start": "0:00:48.45", "end": "0:00:50.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之  有点事到如今也太迟了的感觉"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 12, "start": "0:00:51.56", "end": "0:00:58.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "顺便说一下  我们这身打扮和四字头带不用说也是春日的提案"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 13, "start": "0:00:59.13", "end": "0:01:01.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这究竟有什么意义啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 14, "start": "0:01:01.77", "end": "0:01:04.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说起来  这个可以脱下来了吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 15, "start": "0:01:08.62", "end": "0:01:11.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还是那样令人大吃一惊的违背常理啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 16, "start": "0:01:12.25", "end": "0:01:15.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫与她愉快的伙伴们"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 17, "start": "0:01:15.13", "end": "0:01:15.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要说了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 18, "start": "0:01:16.26", "end": "0:01:19.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我的信条是进行朴素的生活"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 19, "start": "0:01:19.61", "end": "0:01:22.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "亏你们那身装束还能跑得动"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 20, "start": "0:01:22.92", "end": "0:01:24.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "的确跑起来很不方便"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 21, "start": "0:01:25.14", "end": "0:01:26.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "才不是指这方面"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 22, "start": "0:01:27.36", "end": "0:01:30.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次活动一定会留在毕业的相册里的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 23, "start": "0:01:30.42", "end": "0:01:31.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "开心点吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 24, "start": "0:01:31.82", "end": "0:01:32.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你饶了我吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 25, "start": "0:01:37.36", "end": "0:01:38.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 26, "start": "0:01:38.13", "end": "0:01:39.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哇  真恶心"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 27, "start": "0:01:40.44", "end": "0:01:44.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看  那小辫子真可爱啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 28, "start": "0:01:44.69", "end": "0:01:47.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那似乎会无穷无尽的暑假结束了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 29, "start": "0:01:45.12", "end": "0:01:46.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我爱死了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 30, "start": "0:01:47.67", "end": "0:01:51.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二学期开始后  想不到那么快  今天就到运动会了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 31, "start": "0:01:51.92", "end": "0:01:55.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种热闹的日子里春日会不会老老实实地待着"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 32, "start": "0:01:55.40", "end": "0:01:57.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看看现在被卷进来的我们就很清楚了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 33, "start": "0:01:59.36", "end": "0:02:03.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总而言之  春日很喜欢节日这种东西"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 34, "start": "0:03:34.86", "end": "0:03:40.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "总之掀起狂风巨浪的运动会结束后  好不容易过了一个月"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 35, "start": "0:03:40.30", "end": "0:03:42.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没想到眼前又有文化祭在等着"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 36, "start": "0:03:43.41", "end": "0:03:46.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "目前  这县立高中正为此准备工作忙得不可开交"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 37, "start": "0:03:49.00", "end": "0:03:54.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "话又说回来  我跟春日所属的一年五班又会有什么节目呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 38, "start": "0:03:54.54", "end": "0:03:58.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还不是随便用什么问卷调查之类的计划蒙混过关吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 39, "start": "0:03:59.84", "end": "0:04:02.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "自从初春  朝仓凉子不知道跑到什么地方去之后"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 40, "start": "0:04:02.74", "end": "0:04:07.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个班上就没有\n任何企图掌握领导权而又头脑坏掉了的高中生了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 41, "start": "0:04:08.93", "end": "0:04:10.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们走吧  阿虚"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:13.68", "end": "0:04:19.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就这样  今天我仍然怀着有如冷漠症候群\n（Apathy Syndrome）的无力感走向社团教室"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:20.75", "end": "0:04:21.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么要这样？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:21.66", "end": "0:04:27.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原因就是我旁边这威风凛凛的女人这样子说着"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:28.09", "end": "0:04:30.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么问卷调查  蠢到极点"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:30.89", "end": "0:04:35.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那种事有什么好玩的  我真无法理解"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:36.21", "end": "0:04:39.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么你就说出你的意见就好啦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:39.73", "end": "0:04:43.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "教室里气氛像守灵夜一样的  还有冈部老师那无奈的脸"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:43.68", "end": "0:04:44.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不是都看在眼里了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:45.47", "end": "0:04:50.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了  反正我也没有打算参加班上的活动"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:51.48", "end": "0:04:56.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但我倒觉得你在运动会时  对本班夺得综合优胜有着莫大的贡献呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:57.05", "end": "0:05:02.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "参加了大部分的跑道比赛  获得优胜的都是你吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 53, "start": "0:05:02.93", "end": "0:05:04.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难不成那是别人吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 54, "start": "0:05:04.95", "end": "0:05:06.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那和这是两码事"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 55, "start": "0:05:07.31", "end": "0:05:09.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是文化祭啊  文化祭！"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 56, "start": "0:05:09.18", "end": "0:05:12.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不正是一整年里最重要的超级活动吗？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:12.59", "end": "0:05:13.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:14.03", "end": "0:05:18.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是  我们SOS团要做更有趣的事"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:19.10", "end": "0:05:22.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说这话时  凉宫春日的脸就像在第二次布匿战争中"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:19.10", "end": "0:05:22.68", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（注：公元前三世纪到前二世纪期间，罗马和伽太基\n为争夺地中海霸权而进行的三次战争）"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:22.89", "end": "0:05:25.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "决定要穿越阿尔卑斯山的汉尼拔般"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:22.89", "end": "0:05:25.48", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（注：Hannibal，伽太基名将）"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:25.79", "end": "0:05:28.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "绽放着毫无迷惘的明亮光芒！"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:32.86", "end": "0:05:34.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这可是文化祭啊  文化祭"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:34.67", "end": "0:05:37.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你最好也拿出点热情来啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:38.97", "end": "0:05:42.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "高一的文化祭一年也只有一次啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:42.65", "end": "0:05:46.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "话虽如此  但也不必如此大惊小怪吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:46.40", "end": "0:05:47.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这当然值得大惊小怪啦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:47.87", "end": "0:05:49.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不炒得热一点怎么能引起注意呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:50.16", "end": "0:05:53.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我所知道的文化祭大致上都是这样的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 71, "start": "0:05:53.75", "end": "0:05:56.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在初中时做过很夸张的事吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 72, "start": "0:05:56.97", "end": "0:05:59.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "才不  一点都不好玩"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 73, "start": "0:06:00.24", "end": "0:06:03.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以如果高中的文化祭不好玩的话可就烦恼了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:04.63", "end": "0:06:07.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么样的感觉你才会觉得有趣"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:07.91", "end": "0:06:09.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请务必告诉我"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:12.12", "end": "0:06:13.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎  算了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:14.67", "end": "0:06:17.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "进了社团教室再慢慢告诉你"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:21.93", "end": "0:06:23.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "薰衣草的味道～"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:23.50", "end": "0:06:25.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  两位好"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:25.22", "end": "0:06:26.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  如花的少女啊～"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:27.06", "end": "0:06:28.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我马上去泡茶"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:28.45", "end": "0:06:29.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请不用费心！"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:29.80", "end": "0:06:31.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的眼睛眯得像线一样细哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:33.45", "end": "0:06:35.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  古泉呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:35.55", "end": "0:06:38.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还没到呢  说起来也真有点慢啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:42.14", "end": "0:06:43.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  茶还没好吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:43.96", "end": "0:06:45.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是的  马上来"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:50.55", "end": "0:06:51.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 89, "start": "0:06:51.44", "end": "0:06:52.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 90, "start": "0:06:52.47", "end": "0:06:55.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我记得之前跟你说过的  你忘了吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 91, "start": "0:06:55.42", "end": "0:06:57.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎？是什么啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 92, "start": "0:06:58.73", "end": "0:07:04.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "端茶来时  每三次中至少要有一次不小心把茶杯打翻才行"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 93, "start": "0:07:04.52", "end": "0:07:06.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你这样一点都没有迟钝女仆的样子啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:07.44", "end": "0:07:09.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎？啊  对不起…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:09.76", "end": "0:07:13.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这家伙难道认为女仆都是笨手笨脚的吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:13.78", "end": "0:07:15.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在刚好有机会  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:15.46", "end": "0:07:17.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "找阿虚练习一下吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:17.46", "end": "0:07:20.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "端茶的时候要把茶杯从他头上倒下去"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:20.72", "end": "0:07:21.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哎？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:21.71", "end": "0:07:25.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐  春日所说的玩笑只有头脑坏掉的人才能听懂"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:25.66", "end": "0:07:27.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请努力学习吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:27.16", "end": "0:07:30.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那边那个笨蛋  我可没开玩笑哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:30.90", "end": "0:07:32.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我做事永远都是认真的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:32.91", "end": "0:07:34.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那就更有问题了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:35.00", "end": "0:07:38.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了  我来示范一下  然后实玖瑠你再上"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:39.42", "end": "0:07:41.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  哎…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:50.47", "end": "0:07:52.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  等一下"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 108, "start": "0:07:55.59", "end": "0:07:57.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  不要妨碍我啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 109, "start": "0:07:57.77", "end": "0:07:58.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么妨不妨碍啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 110, "start": "0:07:58.78", "end": "0:08:00.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "会有人看着热水将要从自己头上往下倒"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 111, "start": "0:08:01.08", "end": "0:08:02.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而无动于衷的吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:05.07", "end": "0:08:05.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哼"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:15.28", "end": "0:08:16.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "请"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:21.71", "end": "0:08:23.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门你也多少有点高兴的表示吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:23.91", "end": "0:08:26.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "换成谷口的话  可能会花上三天的时间才舍得把它喝完呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:28.41", "end": "0:08:31.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "抱歉  班会延长了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:32.03", "end": "0:08:35.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果因为我的迟到\n而使得会议无法开始进行  我在这里道歉"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:35.81", "end": "0:08:37.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "会议？那是啥啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:38.14", "end": "0:08:39.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不说我还真的忘了呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:39.84", "end": "0:08:44.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "午休时间我通知大家了  我想反正随时都有机会跟你说的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:45.05", "end": "0:08:47.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么明明有空跑到别的教室去"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:47.81", "end": "0:08:51.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "却连告知同一间教室还坐在你前面的我的手续都省略了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:51.59", "end": "0:08:55.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有什么关系  重要的不是在什么时候听到的事"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:55.82", "end": "0:08:57.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而是现在要做什么事"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:57.53", "end": "0:08:58.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你觉得自己讲得很动听吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:58.95", "end": "0:09:02.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "更重要的是  得想想今后要做什么才行"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 127, "start": "0:09:02.77", "end": "0:09:05.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到底是现在时还是未来时  拜托你说清楚好不好"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 128, "start": "0:09:05.47", "end": "0:09:08.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且主语到底是指谁也搞不清楚"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 129, "start": "0:09:08.60", "end": "0:09:12.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是我们所有团员啊  因为这是SOS团的活动"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 130, "start": "0:09:13.15", "end": "0:09:14.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么活动？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 131, "start": "0:09:14.53", "end": "0:09:16.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才不是讲了吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:16.39", "end": "0:09:19.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这段时期内可以称得上是活动的  除了文化祭还有什么呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:19.89", "end": "0:09:22.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果这样  那就不只是团内的活动  是整个学校的活动"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:22.91", "end": "0:09:24.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果真的那么想把文化祭搞得有声有色的话"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:25.09", "end": "0:09:27.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "干脆去当执行委员后补人员不就好了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:27.70", "end": "0:09:30.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到时候肯定会有接踵而来做不完的无聊杂事吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:30.56", "end": "0:09:31.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那就没什么意义了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:32.15", "end": "0:09:35.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们还是得做点有SOS团味道的活动才行"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:36.01", "end": "0:09:38.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们团好不容易才成长到这种程度耶"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:38.31", "end": "0:09:41.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是全校无人不知无人不晓的超注目社团啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 141, "start": "0:09:41.87", "end": "0:09:42.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你知道吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 142, "start": "0:09:43.30", "end": "0:09:46.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不过是随口\n把临时想到的事情说出来而已  当然很轻松了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 143, "start": "0:09:47.28", "end": "0:09:49.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是你知道我跟朝比奈学姐有多辛苦吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 144, "start": "0:09:50.22", "end": "0:09:52.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉只知道圆滑地傻笑"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 145, "start": "0:09:53.30", "end": "0:09:55.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门则是一点忙也帮不上"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 146, "start": "0:09:56.20", "end": "0:09:59.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "至少也要为身为一般人的我考虑一下嘛"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 147, "start": "0:09:59.87", "end": "0:10:02.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们得做些符合大家期待的事情才行"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 148, "start": "0:10:03.18", "end": "0:10:06.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到底哪里的哪位人物会对SOS团有所期待啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 149, "start": "0:10:07.19", "end": "0:10:08.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这才是应该做问卷调查的事情吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 150, "start": "0:10:09.41", "end": "0:10:11.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠班上干什么呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 151, "start": "0:10:11.31", "end": "0:10:15.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们班吗  炒面咖啡馆…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 152, "start": "0:10:15.74", "end": "0:10:17.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠一定是当女服务生吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 153, "start": "0:10:18.31", "end": "0:10:22.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你怎么知道的  但似乎大家都要我做…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:23.53", "end": "0:10:24.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:28.56", "end": "0:10:29.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉的班级呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:30.39", "end": "0:10:33.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "目前决定要演舞台剧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 157, "start": "0:10:33.44", "end": "0:10:36.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要演古典的还是原创的还在争执中"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 158, "start": "0:10:36.76", "end": "0:10:39.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有活力的班级果然比较好啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:40.94", "end": "0:10:42.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然麻烦了点"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 160, "start": "0:10:42.88", "end": "0:10:43.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯…？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 161, "start": "0:10:43.95", "end": "0:10:44.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 162, "start": "0:10:45.09", "end": "0:10:45.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "占卜"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 163, "start": "0:10:45.97", "end": "0:10:46.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "占卜？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 164, "start": "0:10:47.02", "end": "0:10:47.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 165, "start": "0:10:49.59", "end": "0:10:52.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "长门要占卜？是把「预言」给弄错了吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 166, "start": "0:10:53.78", "end": "0:10:56.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦  对了  你看这样如何"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 167, "start": "0:10:56.74", "end": "0:11:00.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们把这些全部集合起来  做戏剧占卜茶会咖啡馆怎么样"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 168, "start": "0:11:00.35", "end": "0:11:03.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哈？别说那种白痴话了  立刻开始进行会议"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 169, "start": "0:11:15.03", "end": "0:11:17.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "上面什么都没写  要我看哪里啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 170, "start": "0:11:18.27", "end": "0:11:19.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "待会就会写的了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 171, "start": "0:11:20.21", "end": "0:11:22.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "实玖瑠  你负责记录"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 172, "start": "0:11:22.78", "end": "0:11:24.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "把我所说的话清清楚楚地写下来"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 173, "start": "0:11:24.95", "end": "0:11:25.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 174, "start": "0:11:26.56", "end": "0:11:29.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么时候朝比奈学姐变成了记录员呢  我也不知道"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 175, "start": "0:11:29.92", "end": "0:11:32.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "恐怕没人知道吧  因为那是春日刚刚才决定的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 176, "start": "0:11:41.81", "end": "0:11:45.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们SOS团要搞一个电影放映会"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 177, "start": "0:11:47.90", "end": "0:11:48.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:51.90", "end": "0:11:56.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我实在不明白春日的脑袋内部到底是怎么切换思路的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 179, "start": "0:11:56.82", "end": "0:11:59.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "其实这倒无所谓  反正她一向如此"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 180, "start": "0:11:59.39", "end": "0:11:59.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 181, "start": "0:12:00.76", "end": "0:12:04.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是哪门子的会议  不过是你个人的表明信念罢了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 182, "start": "0:12:05.29", "end": "0:12:06.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是一向都如此吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 183, "start": "0:12:07.57", "end": "0:12:08.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太近了！"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 184, "start": "0:12:08.24", "end": "0:12:11.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫同学好像一开始就已经决定好要做什么了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 185, "start": "0:12:12.10", "end": "0:12:13.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以大概没有商量的余地了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 186, "start": "0:12:14.37", "end": "0:12:16.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说这样  但为什么要是电影呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 187, "start": "0:12:16.96", "end": "0:12:19.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是不是她昨天深夜从电视上看了一部C级电影"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 188, "start": "0:12:20.19", "end": "0:12:23.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为太过无聊了  所以不知道怎么发泄那种情绪吧？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 189, "start": "0:12:25.70", "end": "0:12:28.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "想必大家经常都会产生疑问吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 190, "start": "0:12:28.80", "end": "0:12:30.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我担心你的脑袋"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 191, "start": "0:12:31.01", "end": "0:12:32.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电视连续剧之类的节目"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 192, "start": "0:12:32.31", "end": "0:12:34.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在完结篇时经常会有人死去"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 193, "start": "0:12:34.79", "end": "0:12:36.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这不会很不自然吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 194, "start": "0:12:36.70", "end": "0:12:39.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么非得那么巧啊  太奇怪了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 195, "start": "0:12:39.98", "end": "0:12:44.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以我很讨厌在结尾的时候有某个人要死亡的剧情"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 196, "start": "0:12:45.25", "end": "0:12:47.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要是我  才不会拍出那种电影呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 197, "start": "0:12:54.22", "end": "0:12:54.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 198, "start": "0:12:55.14", "end": "0:12:56.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这样了  明白吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 199, "start": "0:12:57.23", "end": "0:12:58.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么「就是这样了」？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 200, "start": "0:12:59.12", "end": "0:13:01.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "除了电影上映之外我啥都不知道啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 201, "start": "0:13:01.55", "end": "0:13:02.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你准备去哪里找片商啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 202, "start": "0:13:03.00", "end": "0:13:05.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  你真是个脑筋转不过来的家伙啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 203, "start": "0:13:05.75", "end": "0:13:10.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是我们要拍电影啊  然后要在文化祭上演"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 204, "start": "0:13:11.03", "end": "0:13:13.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "片头要打上Presented by SOS团"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 205, "start": "0:13:14.37", "end": "0:13:16.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这里什么时候变成电影研究部了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 206, "start": "0:13:16.97", "end": "0:13:20.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在说什么啊  这里可是永远的SOS团啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 207, "start": "0:13:20.32", "end": "0:13:22.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可不记得有什么电影研啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 208, "start": "0:13:22.56", "end": "0:13:24.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此  我差不多知道了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 209, "start": "0:13:25.07", "end": "0:13:29.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说我们拍摄自制电影  然后上映"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 210, "start": "0:13:29.61", "end": "0:13:30.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这么回事吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 211, "start": "0:13:31.14", "end": "0:13:32.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这么回事"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 212, "start": "0:13:32.74", "end": "0:13:35.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是…为什么想到要拍电影呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 213, "start": "0:13:36.14", "end": "0:13:40.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "昨天晚上呢  我睡得不是很好"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 214, "start": "0:13:40.52", "end": "0:13:42.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "然后打开电视  看到了奇怪的电影"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 215, "start": "0:13:43.03", "end": "0:13:43.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "果然啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 216, "start": "0:13:43.94", "end": "0:13:46.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那还真是部无聊的电影啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 217, "start": "0:13:47.14", "end": "0:13:50.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "无聊到我都想打恶作剧国际长途电话到导演家里了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 218, "start": "0:13:51.80", "end": "0:13:53.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是我便这么想"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 219, "start": "0:13:53.40", "end": "0:13:56.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种电影  我拍的肯定比他要像样多了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 220, "start": "0:13:56.94", "end": "0:13:57.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哈…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 221, "start": "0:13:57.79", "end": "0:14:00.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以就想着为什么不干呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 222, "start": "0:14:00.35", "end": "0:14:01.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哈…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 223, "start": "0:14:01.29", "end": "0:14:06.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你目标当个导演希望做个制片什么的随你了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 224, "start": "0:14:07.32", "end": "0:14:09.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那我们也能照自己喜欢地做吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 225, "start": "0:14:10.07", "end": "0:14:10.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你指什么"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 226, "start": "0:14:11.41", "end": "0:14:14.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果  我们说不干的话你准备怎么办"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 227, "start": "0:14:14.80", "end": "0:14:16.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只有导演的话是拍不了电影的哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 228, "start": "0:14:16.92", "end": "0:14:19.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "放心吧  剧本我已经想得差不多了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 229, "start": "0:14:20.04", "end": "0:14:22.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊不…我想说的不是这个"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 230, "start": "0:14:22.86", "end": "0:14:24.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么都不需要担心哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 231, "start": "0:14:24.79", "end": "0:14:27.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你就照一直以来那样跟着我就是了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 232, "start": "0:14:27.75", "end": "0:14:29.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "完全用不着你操心哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 233, "start": "0:14:29.90", "end": "0:14:30.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我担心！"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 234, "start": "0:14:30.80", "end": "0:14:33.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一切都交给我吧  我会全部搞定的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 235, "start": "0:14:33.77", "end": "0:14:34.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我更加担心了！"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 236, "start": "0:14:35.05", "end": "0:14:38.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你叽叽喳喳的好烦啊  说干了就干呗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 237, "start": "0:14:38.57", "end": "0:14:41.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "目标文化祭最佳活动投票第一哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 238, "start": "0:14:41.97", "end": "0:14:46.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这么一来\n脑子不清的恶役学生会说不定也会认同SOS团是正式社团了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 239, "start": "0:14:47.14", "end": "0:14:49.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  我绝对会让他们认同的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 240, "start": "0:14:49.33", "end": "0:14:52.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "首先得要让舆论站在我们这边呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 241, "start": "0:14:52.39", "end": "0:14:53.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "制作费你怎么搞"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 242, "start": "0:14:54.15", "end": "0:14:55.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "预算的话有哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 243, "start": "0:14:55.51", "end": "0:14:56.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪里？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 244, "start": "0:14:57.22", "end": "0:14:59.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给文艺部那部分的预算吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 245, "start": "0:14:59.45", "end": "0:15:03.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是文艺部的预算啊  不是你能用的东西"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 246, "start": "0:15:03.54", "end": "0:15:05.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可是有希说没关系啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 247, "start": "0:15:13.27", "end": "0:15:13.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 248, "start": "0:15:16.71", "end": "0:15:20.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大家都明白了吧  比起班级活动要优先我们这里的活动啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 249, "start": "0:15:20.50", "end": "0:15:23.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "反对意见等文化祭结束了再和我说哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 250, "start": "0:15:23.53", "end": "0:15:25.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听好  导演的命令可是绝对的哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 251, "start": "0:15:26.47", "end": "0:15:30.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "团长之后是导演吗  你最后想当啥啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 252, "start": "0:15:30.46", "end": "0:15:32.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别和我说是神啊！"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 253, "start": "0:15:33.82", "end": "0:15:35.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么今天就到此结束"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 254, "start": "0:15:35.58", "end": "0:15:38.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "作为制片人我有很多需要考虑的啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 255, "start": "0:15:40.38", "end": "0:15:42.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "详细的事项明天再告诉大家"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 256, "start": "0:15:46.17", "end": "0:15:46.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呜…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 257, "start": "0:15:47.28", "end": "0:15:48.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这不是很好吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 258, "start": "0:15:49.24", "end": "0:15:52.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比如抓外星怪兽开杂耍团啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 259, "start": "0:15:52.43", "end": "0:15:55.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "击落UFO展示它们的内部构造啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 260, "start": "0:15:55.80", "end": "0:15:58.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不是这样的事情  我已经安心了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 261, "start": "0:15:59.00", "end": "0:16:03.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且我对凉宫同学会拍出怎么样的电影很有兴趣"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 262, "start": "0:16:04.60", "end": "0:16:08.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看样子会是个有趣的文化祭  我很有兴趣哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 263, "start": "0:16:13.32", "end": "0:16:14.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有…有什么事吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 264, "start": "0:16:14.94", "end": "0:16:20.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  没什么  我只是在想接下来春日会带来什么样的衣服"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 265, "start": "0:16:26.65", "end": "0:16:28.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是啊  电影…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 266, "start": "0:16:30.52", "end": "0:16:31.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "电影啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 267, "start": "0:16:32.52", "end": "0:16:37.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "老实说  我多少也有点兴趣  虽然没有古泉那么大"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 268, "start": "0:16:37.88", "end": "0:16:41.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "至少我应该抱着一丝期待吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 269, "start": "0:16:44.65", "end": "0:16:47.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为反正也没人会期待"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 270, "start": "0:16:50.16", "end": "0:16:53.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "马上收回前言  我不该期待的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 271, "start": "0:16:54.27", "end": "0:16:58.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "第二天放学后  我感觉像咬到苦虫了一样"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 272, "start": "0:17:12.53", "end": "0:17:14.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  我该负责什么"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 273, "start": "0:17:14.98", "end": "0:17:16.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就照那里写着的那样啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 274, "start": "0:17:16.83", "end": "0:17:18.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我来做主角吗…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 275, "start": "0:17:19.31", "end": "0:17:23.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个  如果可以的话  我想做个不起眼的角色…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 276, "start": "0:17:23.37", "end": "0:17:26.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不行  实玖瑠你可要好好地引人注目啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 277, "start": "0:17:26.81", "end": "0:17:29.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为你可是这个团的商标一样的东西"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 278, "start": "0:17:29.87", "end": "0:17:32.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "趁现在练习下签名吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 279, "start": "0:17:32.32", "end": "0:17:36.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想试映会的时候  观众们肯定会想要你的签名的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 280, "start": "0:17:36.33", "end": "0:17:38.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那玩意你准备在哪里搞啊！"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 281, "start": "0:17:38.63", "end": "0:17:41.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不会演戏啊…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 282, "start": "0:17:41.65", "end": "0:17:44.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没事  我会好好地指导你的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 283, "start": "0:17:46.07", "end": "0:17:49.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且  有希和古泉还真不认真啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 284, "start": "0:17:49.40", "end": "0:17:52.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我明明说了要以这里优先的  还因为自己班上的活动迟到"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 285, "start": "0:17:53.18", "end": "0:17:54.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我要好好严重警告他们一下"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 286, "start": "0:17:55.05", "end": "0:17:59.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要说也是现在在这里的我们比较奇怪吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 287, "start": "0:17:59.97", "end": "0:18:00.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 288, "start": "0:18:00.82", "end": "0:18:04.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐不参加班级会议没事吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 289, "start": "0:18:04.53", "end": "0:18:09.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  我只是负责服务的  剩下就是试试衣服而已"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 290, "start": "0:18:10.21", "end": "0:18:13.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "会是什么样的衣服呢  有点期待呢"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 291, "start": "0:18:13.64", "end": "0:18:17.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "害羞地笑着的朝比奈学姐好像已经很习惯COSPLAY了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 292, "start": "0:18:18.23", "end": "0:18:20.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "比起在SOS团被穿上无意义的衣服"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 293, "start": "0:18:21.20", "end": "0:18:24.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还不如在适当的场所做适当的打扮吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 294, "start": "0:18:25.40", "end": "0:18:26.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么啊  实玖瑠"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 295, "start": "0:18:27.06", "end": "0:18:31.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你那么想当女服务生的话  我会帮你找衣服来的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 296, "start": "0:18:31.86", "end": "0:18:32.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了  那样也好"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 297, "start": "0:18:33.40", "end": "0:18:34.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  阿虚"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 298, "start": "0:18:34.52", "end": "0:18:37.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你知道拍电影需要什么东西吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 299, "start": "0:18:43.56", "end": "0:18:47.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是创新的想法和投入在制作上的热情吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 300, "start": "0:18:47.40", "end": "0:18:50.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然是摄像机啊  没器材怎么拍啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 301, "start": "0:18:51.36", "end": "0:18:54.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我才不要那么抽象的东西"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 302, "start": "0:18:54.41", "end": "0:18:58.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许是这样  我想说的也不是这种老实巴交的话…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 303, "start": "0:18:58.73", "end": "0:18:59.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…哎  算了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 304, "start": "0:19:00.18", "end": "0:19:04.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这样  现在就去调度摄影机吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 305, "start": "0:19:05.56", "end": "0:19:07.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那…那个  凉…凉宫同学"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 306, "start": "0:19:08.33", "end": "0:19:12.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说起来我还有…有事  需要立刻回教室去…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 307, "start": "0:19:12.72", "end": "0:19:13.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给我安静"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 308, "start": "0:19:15.32", "end": "0:19:16.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要担心啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 309, "start": "0:19:16.48", "end": "0:19:20.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有一次是你说不用担心就真的不用担心的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 310, "start": "0:19:21.02", "end": "0:19:24.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次我可不会拿实玖瑠的身体来抵债啦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 311, "start": "0:19:24.66", "end": "0:19:26.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是要你来帮下忙而已"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 312, "start": "0:19:29.22", "end": "0:19:34.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "告诉我们需要帮什么忙吧  不然我和朝比奈学姐便坐在这里不动"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 313, "start": "0:19:34.54", "end": "0:19:39.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我要去找赞助商调度啦  带着女主角印象会好点吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 314, "start": "0:19:39.43", "end": "0:19:42.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你也来吧  帮忙搬东西"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 315, "start": "0:19:47.44", "end": "0:19:51.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在明明都秋天了  但怎么就一丁点儿都不凉快"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 316, "start": "0:19:52.38", "end": "0:19:58.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "地球好像脱线了一样  似乎忘记把秋天这个季节带到日本了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 317, "start": "0:20:06.47", "end": "0:20:11.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们下山后  搭上私铁的区域线路  坐了三站左右"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 318, "start": "0:20:11.90", "end": "0:20:17.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是当初我和朝比奈学姐两人一起散步过的樱花道附近"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 319, "start": "0:20:26.30", "end": "0:20:26.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这里"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 320, "start": "0:20:27.72", "end": "0:20:28.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 321, "start": "0:20:29.61", "end": "0:20:34.00", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她估计是要向这家店勒索电影器材"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 322, "start": "0:20:34.60", "end": "0:20:35.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但她准备怎么做啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 323, "start": "0:20:36.24", "end": "0:20:39.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "稍微等下啊  我去谈下"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 324, "start": "0:20:40.20", "end": "0:20:40.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个帮我拿着"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 325, "start": "0:20:41.57", "end": "0:20:42.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哦…"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 326, "start": "0:20:48.64", "end": "0:20:54.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要是春日想动一点可疑的动作  我就这么把朝比奈学姐夹在腋下逃走"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 327, "start": "0:20:58.45", "end": "0:21:02.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙说的话  可别轻易相信啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 328, "start": "0:21:02.66", "end": "0:21:05.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我是不是该这么忠告下那位面善的大叔啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 329, "start": "0:21:06.37", "end": "0:21:07.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她在干什么啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 330, "start": "0:21:08.24", "end": "0:21:15.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁知道  反正就是向对方免费借用\n这店里性能最好的数码手持摄像机这类的吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 331, "start": "0:21:16.31", "end": "0:21:19.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她可是能够面不改色地做这种事的人啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 332, "start": "0:21:19.79", "end": "0:21:20.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真伤脑筋"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 333, "start": "0:21:21.41", "end": "0:21:25.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日深信自己的价值标准和判断是绝对的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 334, "start": "0:21:25.86", "end": "0:21:30.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别人的意思和意识和她有点不同  该说是完全不同"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 335, "start": "0:21:30.63", "end": "0:21:32.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她可是搞不懂这一点的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 336, "start": "0:21:33.05", "end": "0:21:34.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要实现超光速飞行的话"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 337, "start": "0:21:35.20", "end": "0:21:37.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让春日坐上宇宙船就好了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 338, "start": "0:21:37.21", "end": "0:21:39.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她估计很轻松地便能无视相对论了吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 339, "start": "0:21:40.29", "end": "0:21:41.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好像结束了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 340, "start": "0:21:44.24", "end": "0:21:45.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看～"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 341, "start": "0:21:47.16", "end": "0:21:50.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这样第一步算是成功了  真顺利啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 342, "start": "0:21:50.86", "end": "0:21:53.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你是怎么搞到这么贵的东西的啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 343, "start": "0:21:54.07", "end": "0:21:57.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那位大叔有什么把柄在你手里吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 344, "start": "0:21:57.34", "end": "0:22:01.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么会啊  好好跟他说明了一下他就心满意足地让给我了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 345, "start": "0:22:01.66", "end": "0:22:04.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "会给的话我也想要  告诉我决定性的那台词吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 346, "start": "0:22:05.13", "end": "0:22:05.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也没什么啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 347, "start": "0:22:06.04", "end": "0:22:10.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是说「我想拍电影  所以给我吧」\n他就给了  什么问题也没有"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 348, "start": "0:22:10.32", "end": "0:22:13.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在是没事  但我感觉将来可是会有问题"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 349, "start": "0:22:14.27", "end": "0:22:19.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要什么都放在心上啊  你只要落落大方地当我的仆人就好了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 350, "start": "0:22:22.54", "end": "0:22:24.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了  去下一家店吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 351, "start": "0:22:31.59", "end": "0:22:32.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我渐渐明白了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 352, "start": "0:22:33.11", "end": "0:22:38.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "指着我们的时候  春日的食指不偏不倚地指着朝比奈学姐"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 353, "start": "0:22:38.55", "end": "0:22:43.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "估计是拿朝比奈学姐以什么方式来抵债"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 354, "start": "0:22:44.27", "end": "0:22:45.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "告诉她比较好吧"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 355, "start": "0:22:47.02", "end": "0:22:47.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看～"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 356, "start": "0:22:48.09", "end": "0:22:48.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这次又是什么"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 357, "start": "0:22:49.28", "end": "0:22:50.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是武器啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 358, "start": "0:22:51.79", "end": "0:22:52.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 359, "start": "0:22:52.93", "end": "0:22:54.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你要这种东西干什么啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 360, "start": "0:22:54.47", "end": "0:22:57.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拍动作场面要用啊  枪战哦"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 361, "start": "0:22:57.41", "end": "0:23:00.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "激烈互攻可是娱乐的基本啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 362, "start": "0:23:00.25", "end": "0:23:05.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可以的话我还想拍摄把大楼炸了之类的  你知道哪里有卖炸药吗"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 363, "start": "0:23:05.53", "end": "0:23:07.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不知道杂货店有没有啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 364, "start": "0:23:07.11", "end": "0:23:10.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谁知道啊  至少网购你是买不到的"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 365, "start": "0:23:10.54", "end": "0:23:12.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且  这些货物要怎么办啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 366, "start": "0:23:12.92", "end": "0:23:16.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "先带回家  明天再带到社团教室"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 367, "start": "0:23:16.60", "end": "0:23:18.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在回学校太麻烦了"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 368, "start": "0:23:18.99", "end": "0:23:19.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我来？"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 369, "start": "0:23:19.71", "end": "0:23:20.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是你"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 370, "start": "0:23:20.54", "end": "0:23:24.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那是在教室里不大看得到的SOS团专用的微笑"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 371, "start": "0:23:24.31", "end": "0:23:29.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "每次春日这么笑了  灾难般的善后工作便会绕到我头上"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 372, "start": "0:23:30.16", "end": "0:23:32.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "简直是个反例的稻秸长者啊"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 373, "start": "0:23:30.16", "end": "0:23:32.02", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（わらしべちょうじゃ：日本的民间故事）"}
{"ep": "20", "idx": 374, "start": "0:23:33.86", "end": "0:23:34.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个…"}
